To jsonparse n as whole number.
    If n is at most 0.
        Give back 1 as whole number.
    Otherwise if n is at most 1.
        Give back 3 as whole number.
    Changeable n1 is n minus 1.
    Changeable n2 is n minus 2.
    Changeable n3 is n minus 3.
    Changeable v1 is jsonparse n1.
    Changeable v2 is jsonparse n2.
    Changeable v3 is jsonparse n3.
    Changeable s1 is v1 plus v2.
    Changeable s2 is s1 plus v3.
    Changeable n2x is n plus n.
    Changeable s3 is s2 plus n2x.
    Give back s3 as whole number.
Say jsonparse 32.
